        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Debora na Baraki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Ehudi akuure, Abaisraeli bagakora ebibe ase obosio bw’Omonene naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ig’Omonene akabatiga bakabugwa na Yabini, omorwoti o Kaanani, oyorenge kogaambera omochie o Hasori. Omotang’ani bw’emeganda yaye y’eseegi nigo arenge korokwa Sisera. Ere nigo amenyete Haroseti, omochie bw’Ebisaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabini nigo abwate chigari chi’ebioma amagana kianda. Ere agachaanda Abaisraeli mono ase obotindi obonene ase engaki y’emiaka emerongo ebere, n’Abaisraeli bakarera ase Omonene abakoonye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eria omobani Debora, moka Lapidoti, nigo arenge omogambi bw’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere nigo anarete goikaransa inse y’omote orenge korokwa Omokendo o Debora, egati ya Rama na Beteli, ase ense y’ebitunwa ya Efraimu na Abaisraeli nigo baanarete goocha ase are abagaayane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko erimo akarangeria Baraki, mosinto bw’Abinoamu, korwa ase omochie o Kedesi bw’ense ya Nafutali, akamoteebia, “Aya nar’Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agochiikire: Genda ochoore abanto chilifu ikomi korwa ase eamate ya Nafutali na eya Sabuloni, obaire gochia ase Egetunwa gia Tabori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche nimoseegete Sisera, omotang’ani bw’emeganda y’eseegi, y’omorwoti Yabini amo ne chigari chiaye n’emegaanda yaye, goocha ase ore, agwo ase Orooche rwa Kisoni, na aroro nimobeeke ase amaboko ao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraki akamoiraneria Debora, “Aye korageende amo nainche, rirorio ningeende, korende otageendeti amo nainche, tinkogeenda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Debora akamoiraneria, “Goika ’’ngende amo naye, korende orogeendo oro tirogokorentera ogotogigwa, ekiagera Omonene nigo agochia gotiga Sisera agwe ase amaboko y’omokuungu.” Erio Debora akaimoka akageenda amo na Baraki, bagaika Kedesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Baraki akabarangeria abanto ba Nafutali amo na Abasabuloni bache Kedesi, n’abanto chilifu ikomi bagatiira amo na Baraki, na Debora akageenda amo nere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Heberi Omokeni akayetenenia eema yaye ang’e Omoaluni ase Sananimu, ang’e na Kedesi. Ere konya bweatananire korwa ase Abakeni bande. Abakeni nigo barenge ab’ororeeria rwa Hobabu, mokoyoye Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisera agateebigwa ng’a Baraki, mosinto bw’Abinoamu, otiirire gochia ase Egetunwa gia Tabori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio agasangereria chigari chiaye amagana kianda, amo n’abarwani baye bonsi, korwa ase Haroseti, omochie bw’Ebisaku, gochia ase orooche rwa Kisoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Debora akamoteebia Baraki, “Imoka, ogende! Rituko ria reero nario Omonene amobeekire Sisera ase amaboko ao. Omonene ogotang’aneire aye gochia korwana esegi.” Baraki agatirimboka korwa ase Egetunwa gia Tabori amo n’abanto chilifu ikomi baare komotunyana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akamoondokia na komotantania Sisera amo ne chigari chiaye amo n’omoganda bw’abarwani bonsi b’esegi. Erio abarwani abwo bagatama korwa ase omoro o Baraki, na Sisera omonyene agaika korwa ase egari yaye, agatama n’amagoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraki akabwatia chigari n’omoganda bw’abarwani b’esegi goika Haroseti, omochie bw’ebisaku, n’omoganda bwonsi bw’abarwani b’esegi o Sisera ogaitwa, monto onde taiyo nonya n’oyomo ominchoretie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisera akamonyoka, agatama gochia ase eema ya Yaeli, moka Heberi Omokeni, ekiagera ase engaki eria Yabini, omorwoti o Hasori, n’eamate ya Heberi Omokeni nigo barenge abasani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaeli agasooka korotota Sisera, akamoteebia, “Omonene one, gobera gochaa aa, soa ime aa, toba n’obwoba!” Erio Sisera agasoa ase eema ya Yaeli, na Yaeli akamobisia egetambaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisera agateebia Yaeli, “Ing’a amaache inywe! Igo inde n’erang’o.” Omokungu oria agakuunora ekerandi kiare n’amabeere, akamoa, nere akanywa. Magega y’ayio Yaeli akamobisia naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisera agateebia Yaeli, “Tenena ase egesieri ki’eema, na monto onde bwensi orache akoborie iga, Onde nare ime aa? Mokanie yaya, onde taiyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sisera konya orosire mono, akarara chitoro chindito, ko bono, Yaeli, moka Heberi, akaimokia ekeroochi ki’eema na ekegoogi agachoba ng’ora ng’ora gochia ase Sisera, akamoaka ekeroochi keria korwa chintakunero gochia ase omotwe, akamobwaterania inse ase riroba, Sisera agakwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Engaki eria Baraki agacha, okomorigia Sisera, na Yaeli agasooka komoorotota, akamoteebia, “Inchuo, ’nkworokie omonto oria okorigia.” Baraki agasoa nyomba amo nere, akanyora Sisera orambereretie inse, okwete, n’ekerochi kere ase chintakunero chiaye ime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko riria Nyasae akabaa Abaisraeli chinguru bakamobua Yabini, omorwoti o Kaanani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Abaisraeli bakamoengera Yabini, omorwoti o Kaanani goika bakamosiria kegima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
